<section>

<h1>
Get in Touch
</h1>

<p>
Reaching out is the first step. Whether you have questions about our program,
insurance, or are ready to begin treatment, we are here to help.
</p>


<div class="grid">

<article>
<header>
Phone
</header>

<a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">
{{ site.phone }}
</a>

</article>


<article>
<header>
Email
</header>

<a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
{{ site.email }}
</a>

</article>


<article>
<header>
Address
</header>

<p>
{{ site.address }}
</p>

</article>

</div>

</section>


<section>

<h2>
Contact Form
</h2>


<form
name="contact"
method="POST"
data-netlify="true"
>

<input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">


<label>
Name

<input
type="text"
name="name"
required
>

</label>


<label>
Phone

<input
type="tel"
name="phone"
>

</label>


<label>
Email

<input
type="email"
name="email"
required
>

</label>


<label>
Message

<textarea
name="message"
rows="6"
></textarea>

</label>


<button type="submit">
Send Message
</button>


</form>

</section>


<section>

<p>
<strong>
If you are experiencing a medical or mental health emergency:
</strong>
</p>

<p>
Please call 911 or go to your nearest emergency room.
For immediate crisis support, contact the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline by
calling or texting 988.
</p>

</section>
